{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":573121,"name":"","username":"JM20_AISolutions","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/jm20_aisolutions/{size}/184848_2.png","created_at":"2026-08-07T20:56:37.370Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi everyone,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m an AI Automation Consultant focused on building practical AI-powered workflows and agents with \u003cstrong\u003en8n, LLMs, MCP, APIs, databases and business integrations\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m currently looking for \u003cstrong\u003efreelance, contract or project-based opportunities\u003c/strong\u003e where I can help businesses automate real processes using AI.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSome of the systems I’ve built include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI Customer Support Agent\u003c/strong\u003e for WhatsApp, Telegram and web chat, with text and voice through Vapi.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomer and stock enquiries handled through AI workflows.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAppointment creation, modification and cancellation through \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://Cal.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eCal.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMCP\u003c/strong\u003e integrations allowing agents to interact with external tools.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHuman escalation through \u003cstrong\u003eSlack\u003c/strong\u003e for complex or sensitive cases.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGuardrails and controlled workflows for sensitive data and higher-risk interactions.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAutomated communications using \u003cstrong\u003eResend\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI Business Intelligence Agent\u003c/strong\u003e connected to Supabase, allowing business owners to ask questions about their data using natural language or voice.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAnalytics dashboard connected to the customer-support database.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy focus is not simply building chatbots, but connecting AI to \u003cstrong\u003ereal business processes, systems and data\u003c/strong\u003e so that agents can actually perform useful tasks.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve put together a portfolio showing some of the systems and architecture:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://jm20aisolutions.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://jm20aisolutions.com/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re looking for someone to build or improve an n8n/AI automation workflow, I’d be interested in discussing the project.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-08-07T20:56:37.370Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":61,"reads":42,"readers_count":41,"score":313.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":306636,"topic_slug":"for-hire-ai-automation-n8n-specialist-available-for-projects-freelance-work","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://jm20aisolutions.com/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"JM20 — AI Automation for EU Businesses","clicks":21},{"url":"http://Cal.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Cal.com | Scheduling Software for Online Bookings","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":186039,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"mentioned_users":[],"post_url":"/t/for-hire-ai-automation-n8n-specialist-available-for-projects-freelance-work/306636/1","lo