, WhatsApp integrations, Supabase/Postgres, Docker and Linux VPS deployments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf your agency has more than one project coming in, or you need extra technical capacity without hiring someone full-time, I’m available to work white-label and take care of implementation, debugging and deployment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m particularly interested in smaller or urgent projects that need to get into production quickly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI can send you a few examples of what I’ve built and, if you already have something waiting to be implemented, I can take a look today.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.aiprotocol.com.br/en\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/original/3X/e/6/e6a972b1f97b0555c144b6e6971640342e2ab9c0.png\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"111242\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"\u003e\n\n      \u003ca href=\"https://www.aiprotocol.com.br/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eAI Protocol\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/header\u003e\n\n  \u003carticle class=\"onebox-body\"\u003e\n    \n\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.aiprotocol.com.br/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eAndressa Cabral | Software Engineer · AI \u0026amp; Automation\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n  \u003cp\u003eI build products end to end: Node and TypeScript APIs behind React and Next.js interfaces, AI agents that do real work, and automations that run on their own 24/7. I founded AI Protocol to ship that as product, not as slideware.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n  \u003c/article\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"onebox-metadata\"\u003e\n    \n    \n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"clear: both\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-01T16:10:33.779Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":4,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":13,"readers_count":12,"score":2.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":306636,"topic_slug":"for-hire-ai-automation-n8n-specialist-available-for-projects-freelance-work","display_username":"Andressa Cabral","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://www.aiprotocol.com.br/en","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Andressa Cabral | Software Engineer · AI \u0026 Automation | AI Protocol","clicks":2}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":187074,"username":"Marioco","name":"Mario","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/6a8cbe/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":190538,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"mentioned_users":[],"post_url":"/t/for-hire-ai-automation-n8n-specialist-available-for-projects-freelance-work/306636/5","locale":null,"is_localized":false,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":588647,"name":"Brodin","username":"Brodin11","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/brodin11/{size}/191301_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T07:42:13.417Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey Marioco\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m reaching out with a narrower offer than a general n8n developer pitch.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m looking to take on small implementation pieces that agencies would rather hand off than spend their own time completing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe work I’m best positioned to help with right now is:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e• Python prototypes and processing scripts\u003cbr\u003e\n• CSV/Excel cleanup and transformation\u003cbr\u003e\n• data validation and deduplication\u003cbr\u003e\n• structured extraction\u003cbr\u003e\n• simple API/data processing\u003cbr\u003e\n• testing and QA\u003cbr\u003e\n• technical documentation\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m not going to claim deep production experience across every automation stack.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstead, if you have one bounded client task sitting in the backlog, send me the input/spec and required result.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m happy to start with a small paid fixed-price pilot so you can judge the actual output before considering me for anything else.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI can work completely async if that’s easier.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T07:42:13.417Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":1.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":306636,"topic_slug":"for-hire-ai-automation-n8n-specialist-available-for-projects-freelance-work","display_username":"Brodin","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":194235,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"mentioned_users":[],"post_url":"/t/for-hire-ai-automation-n8n-specialist-available-for-projects-freelance-work/306636/6","locale":null,"is_localized":false,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can